{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2196","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Another Problem about Beautiful Pairs"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the array $$$a$$$, we call a pair of indices $$$i$$$, $$$j$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if the following condition holds:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_{i} \\cdot a_{j} = j - i$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Count the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" pairs in the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^{5}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_{i}$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_{i} \\le 10^{9}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additional constraints on the input: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The sum of $$$n$$$ across all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the answer to the problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n5\n1 1 2 100 4\n6\n2 2 1 1 2 2\n10\n1 1 2 3 4 1 1 7 3 9\n2\n1000000000 1000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n7\n10\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, there are $$$3$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" pairs: ($$$1, 2$$$), ($$$1, 3$$$), and ($$$1, 5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, there are $$$7$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" pairs: ($$$1, 3$$$), ($$$1, 5$$$), ($$$2, 4$$$), ($$$2, 6$$$), ($$$3, 4$$$), ($$$3, 5$$$), and ($$$4, 6$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"2196B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUr